<title>MALTA: PRESS DIGEST - MALTA - APRIL 14.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - MALTA - APRIL 14.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Maltese press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>THE TIMES</p>
<p>- First foreign ministers arrive for Euro-Mediterranean foreign ministers' meeting in Malta.</p>
<p>IN-NAZZJON</p>
<p>- Opposition leader hits out at government for not publishing an Interntional Monetary Fund report.</p>
<p>L-ORIZZONT</p>
<p>- Euro-Med Civil Forum ends. The forum grouped some 130 representatives who appealed for greater European assistance to Arab countries.</p>
